{
  "name": "Watchdog OAuth ML - Vitagel",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Watchdog OAuth ML - Vitagel\n\nRed de seguridad independiente del OAuth Manager.\nCada 2h chequea si el token expira pronto (<2h) y lo refresca.\nSi falla, envía alerta Gmail a you@example.com.\n\n**Credentials:** PostgreSQL + Gmail OAuth2 (attach your own)\n**App ML:** <ML_CLIENT_ID>"
      },
      "id": "wd-0001",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Watchdog Info",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        192,
        -96
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "hours",
              "hoursInterval": 2
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "wd-0010",
      "name": "Schedule Watchdog",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [
        208,
        160
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "executeQuery",
        "query": "SELECT refresh_token, access_token, expires_at, EXTRACT(EPOCH FROM (expires_at - NOW())) / 3600 AS hours_remaining FROM ml_tokens WHERE app_id = 'vitagel' LIMIT 1",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "wd-0020",
      "name": "Check Token Expiry",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.postgres",
      "typeVersion": 2.6,
      "position": [
        448,
        160
      ],
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 2000
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "version": 3,
            "leftValue": "",
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "typeValidation": "strict"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "wd-cond-001",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.hours_remaining.toNumber() }}",
              "rightValue": 2,
              "operator": {
                "type": "number",
                "operation": "lt"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "wd-0030",
      "name": "Token Expiring Soon?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.3,
      "position": [
        704,
        160
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "wd-0040",
      "name": "No Action",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.noOp",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        960,
        304
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.mercadolibre.com/oauth/token",
        "sendBody": true,
        "contentType": "form-urlencoded",
        "bodyParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "grant_type",
              "value": "refresh_token"
            },
            {
              "name": "client_id",
              "value": "<ML_CLIENT_ID>"
            },
            {
              "name": "client_secret",
              "value": "<ML_CLIENT_SECRET>"
            },
            {
              "name": "refresh_token",
              "value": "={{ $('Check Token Expiry').item.json.refresh_token }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "wd-0050",
      "name": "Refresh Token",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.3,
      "position": [
        960,
        80
      ],
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "version": 3,
            "leftValue": "",
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "typeValidation": "strict"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "wd-cond-002",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.access_token }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "notEmpty"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "wd-0060",
      "name": "Refresh OK?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.3,
      "position": [
        1232,
        80
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "executeQuery",
        "query": "UPDATE ml_tokens SET access_token = $1, refresh_token = $2, token_type = $3, expires_in = $4, scope = $5, user_id = $6, expires_at = NOW() + INTERVAL '1 second' * $4, updated_at = NOW() WHERE app_id = 'vitagel'",
        "options": {
          "queryReplacement": "={{ $json.access_token }},={{ $json.refresh_token }},={{ $json.token_type }},={{ $json.expires_in }},={{ $json.scope }},={{ $json.user_id }}"
        }
      },
      "id": "wd-0070",
      "name": "Update Tokens",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.postgres",
      "typeVersion": 2.6,
      "position": [
        1504,
        0
      ],
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 2000
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "sendTo": "you@example.com",
        "subject": "=🚨 WATCHDOG: OAuth ML Vitagel - Token MUERTO",
        "message": "=⚠️ WATCHDOG ALERT - Token ML Vitagel\n\nEl refresh automático del Watchdog FALLÓ.\n\nTimestamp: {{ $now.toISO() }}\nHoras restantes del token: {{ $('Check Token Expiry').item.json.hours_remaining }}\nExpires at: {{ $('Check Token Expiry').item.json.expires_at }}\nError recibido: {{ JSON.stringify($('Refresh Token').item.json) }}\n\n🔴 ACCIÓN REQUERIDA:\n1. Revisá el workflow OAuth Manager\n2. Ejecutá manualmente el refresh\n3. Si el refresh_token murió, re-autorizá desde la URL de OAuth",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "wd-0080",
      "name": "Alert Refresh Failed",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.gmail",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        1504,
        208
      ]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Schedule Watchdog": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Check Token Expiry",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Check Token Expiry": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Token Expiring Soon?",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Token Expiring Soon?": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Refresh Token",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "node": "No Action",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Refresh Token": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Refresh OK?",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Refresh OK?": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Update Tokens",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "node": "Alert Refresh Failed",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "active": false,
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1",
    "timezone": "America/Argentina/Buenos_Aires",
    "saveDataErrorExecution": "all",
    "saveDataSuccessExecution": "all",
    "errorWorkflow": "Q7Re72V4C7cxIQNR",
    "callerPolicy": "workflowsFromSameOwner",
    "availableInMCP": false
  }
}